bank_request_text:
Hello,

We received EUR 18,750 to your account from [crypto exchange] on 02.09.2026. To complete our review, please provide:

- A full transaction history from the exchange account showing the purchase and sale of the crypto-assets;
- Evidence of the source of the funds originally used to buy the crypto-assets (e.g. bank statements showing transfers to the exchange);
- The wallet addresses you used, if assets were moved outside the exchange;
- Information whether the income has been declared to the State Revenue Service.

Please reply within 10 business days.

Baltic Example Bank AS

Dear Client,

Our records show that 100% of the shares in SIA "[Company]" are held by [Holding] Ltd (Cyprus). To complete the identification of the ultimate beneficial owners, please provide:

1. An ownership structure chart down to natural persons, with percentages;
2. Certificate of shareholders and directors of [Holding] Ltd, not older than 6 months, apostilled;
3. If any trust, foundation or nominee arrangement exists in the structure, the trust deed / nominee agreement and identification of settlor, trustees, protector and beneficiaries;
4. Explanation of the economic rationale for the holding structure.

The UBO data must match the information in the Register of Enterprises.

Corporate Compliance

Labdien!

SIA "[Uzņēmums]" konta atvēršanas pieteikuma izskatīšanai lūdzam iesniegt:
1. Pēdējā gada pārskatu;
2. Biznesa plānu vai darbības aprakstu nākamajiem 12 mēnešiem;
3. Informāciju par pamatkapitāla izcelsmi;
4. Galveno sadarbības partneru sarakstu.

Klientu apkalpošanas daļa

Dear Applicant,

Thank you for your application to open an account. To proceed, please provide:
- A valid residence permit or proof of legal stay in Latvia;
- Confirmation of enrolment from your university;
- Proof of address in Latvia (rental agreement or declaration of residence);
- Information on your source of income during studies.

We will review your application once all documents are received.

Customer Onboarding

Labdien!

SIA "[Uzņēmums]" kontā saņemts EUR 120 000 no dalībnieka ar mērķi "aizdevums". Tajā pašā dienā EUR 118 000 pārskaitīti notāra depozītā.

Lūdzam iesniegt:
1. Aizdevuma līgumu starp dalībnieku un sabiedrību;
2. Dalībnieka līdzekļu izcelsmes apliecinājumu;
3. Nekustamā īpašuma pirkuma līgumu vai tā projektu;
4. Informāciju par īpašuma turpmāko izmantošanu.

